# The virtio-gpu test kernel (M8 graphics G1 loop 3; images/build.sh linux-gpu):
# allnoconfig + images/linux.fragment + these. DRM with the virtio-gpu driver built in
# (no fbdev emulation, no fbcon: the test's init is the only DRM master and talks KMS
# through ioctls, docs/testing.md "the gpu guest"). tmpfs is what GEM's shmem objects
# live in.
CONFIG_DRM=y
CONFIG_DRM_VIRTIO_GPU=y
CONFIG_SHMEM=y
CONFIG_TMPFS=y
CONFIG_DRM_VIRTIO_GPU_KMS=y
